## SQ-NDM-08
@group B (pre-install save copy)
@commands Load a world saved with the 3.1 jar that has a placed Hoglin Mount, a Blackstone Stove with items, a Fungus Colony on rich soul soil, an empty flower pot
@pass all blocks still there with the same ids, the stove keeps its items, no missing-registry warning for `nethersdelight:`
@fails id changed or save format changed: compare against 3.1
@draft needs a world saved with the old Nether's Delight 3.1 jar (Hoglin Mount, Blackstone Stove with items, colony on rich soul soil, empty pot) as the boot's level: no such save exists in the scratch kit; once one exists the reads are cdevtest state / be at its known positions
